      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Medical history?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:47",
      "end_timestamp": "01:48",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "High blood pressure, obviously. And arthritis in my hips.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:50",
      "end_timestamp": "01:56",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Let me check you. Pulse 76, blood pressure 138 over 84, temperature 36.6, oxygen 97 percent, breathing 16, weight 79 kilos.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:12",
      "end_timestamp": "02:22",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]",
        "vital_signs[1]",
        "vital_signs[2]",
        "vital_signs[3]",
        "vital_signs[4]",
        "vital_signs[5]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Your chest is clear on both sides, no wheeze, no crackles.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:53",
      "end_timestamp": "03:00",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "It sounds as if the cough is coming from the lisinopril. It's a known side effect of that group of tablets.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:08",
      "end_timestamp": "03:20",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'd like to rule out other causes first. I'd like to arrange a chest X-ray, and some blood tests.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:50",
      "end_timestamp": "03:59",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "procedures_and_investigations[1]",
        "clinical_actions[0]",
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "In the meantime, a spoonful of honey before bed can help soothe the tickle.",
